    "key_findings": [
      "Augmenting input price data with technical indicators has a significant positive effect on final returns, sometimes moving a model from a negative return to a positive one.",
      "All tested machine learning models (k-NN, Random Forest, XGBoost) achieved positive returns and profit factors above 1.0 on the unseen 66-day test spans across the cryptocurrency pairs.",
      "The highest profit factor observed in the experiments was 1.63 for the ZEC-BTC market using the k-NN model over a 66-day span."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "The resulting strategies lack 'smoothness' in their equity graphs, showing large potential risks for implementation.",
      "Designing a full autonomous trading system involves practical concerns not fully addressed in the research, such as market liquidity issues."
    ],
